WEBVTT

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.708
So here, we call it
1,000 cities with one face.

00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:36.351
So as an architect in China,

00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:39.167
I have to ask myself,
what can I do about it?

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:43.518
One day, I was walking on a street,

00:01:43.542 --> 00:01:45.643
I saw people selling fish.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:48.976
And they put the fish
in this cubic fish tank.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.976
So I was asking the same question,

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.684
why a cubic space for fish?

00:01:53.708 --> 00:01:56.018
Do they like cubic space?

00:01:56.042 --> 00:01:57.059
(Laughter)

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:58.643
Obviously not.

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:02.518
So maybe the cubic space,
cubic architecture,